WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:02.969
Is the clock running out on tick tock?

00:00:03.169 --> 00:00:04.537
It could be for federal government

00:00:04.537 --> 00:00:06.272
employees after Congress included

00:00:06.272 --> 00:00:08.341
a ban on the app on all U.S.

00:00:08.341 --> 00:00:09.376
government devices.

00:00:09.376 --> 00:00:10.377
And the latest spending bill

00:00:10.377 --> 00:00:11.311
joining a wave of U.S.

00:00:11.311 --> 00:00:12.812
governors who have done the same

00:00:12.812 --> 00:00:14.381
for their state employees.

00:00:14.381 --> 00:00:16.016
They're worried about the popular apps

00:00:16.016 --> 00:00:17.817
ties to the Chinese government.

00:00:17.817 --> 00:00:19.819
Lawmakers on both sides of the aisle

00:00:19.819 --> 00:00:22.455
concerned. Listen

00:00:23.123 --> 00:00:25.792
Tick tock is a enormous threat.

00:00:25.825 --> 00:00:26.860
This company should be banned.

00:00:26.860 --> 00:00:27.694
I don't know why they're allowed

00:00:27.694 --> 00:00:28.928
to operate in the United States.

00:00:28.928 --> 00:00:29.596
I think it gives

00:00:29.596 --> 00:00:31.064
the Chinese Communist Party

00:00:31.064 --> 00:00:33.066
an opportunity to spy on all of us.

00:00:34.167 --> 00:00:35.602
Today, the company Tick

00:00:35.602 --> 00:00:36.770
Tock said it will roll down

00:00:36.770 --> 00:00:37.370
a new feature.

00:00:37.370 --> 00:00:38.805
To add more context

00:00:38.805 --> 00:00:40.573
about how the app recommends

00:00:40.573 --> 00:00:41.307
videos, users

00:00:41.307 --> 00:00:42.842
will be able to click on an icon

00:00:42.842 --> 00:00:44.511
and see if a video was recommended

00:00:44.511 --> 00:00:45.745
based on data

00:00:45.745 --> 00:00:47.147
such as your past links

00:00:47.147 --> 00:00:48.481
or the region you live in.

00:00:48.481 --> 00:00:49.082
Joining us now

00:00:49.082 --> 00:00:49.649
to discuss

00:00:49.649 --> 00:00:50.950
Michael Beckerman, TikTok's

00:00:50.950 --> 00:00:52.619
head of public policy

00:00:52.619 --> 00:00:53.820
Michael, thanks so much for being here.

00:00:53.820 --> 00:00:55.055
We really appreciate it. First of all.

00:00:55.055 --> 00:00:56.523
What's your response

00:00:56.523 --> 00:00:57.490
to this bipartisan

00:00:57.490 --> 00:00:58.091
push to

00:00:58.091 --> 00:00:59.259
to ban TikTok,

00:00:59.259 --> 00:01:01.461
especially on government devices?

00:01:01.461 --> 00:01:02.228
Look, I mean, obviously,

00:01:02.228 --> 00:01:03.997
this is a very political approach,

00:01:03.997 --> 00:01:05.632
doesn't have any real impact

00:01:05.632 --> 00:01:07.233
on national security.

00:01:07.233 --> 00:01:08.735
But the concerns they're raising

00:01:08.735 --> 00:01:10.970
are ones that we think are solvable.

00:01:10.970 --> 00:01:11.671
And we have a

00:01:11.671 --> 00:01:12.906
really comprehensive solution.

00:01:12.906 --> 00:01:14.607
And so the better question is

00:01:14.607 --> 00:01:17.177
maybe for the administration on enacting

00:01:17.177 --> 00:01:17.911
a security deal

00:01:17.911 --> 00:01:20.246
that that actually safeguards

00:01:20.246 --> 00:01:21.548
information for all Americans,

00:01:21.548 --> 00:01:23.516
a security deal with TikTok

00:01:23.516 --> 00:01:25.118
or with or with the Chinese government.

00:01:25.118 --> 00:01:27.320
With tick tock.

00:01:27.320 --> 00:01:29.255
Tick tock is not available in China.

00:01:29.255 --> 00:01:29.456
You know,

00:01:29.456 --> 00:01:31.624
we think a lot of the concerns are

00:01:31.624 --> 00:01:32.625
maybe overblown,

00:01:32.625 --> 00:01:33.760
but we do think that

00:01:33.760 --> 00:01:35.462
these problems can be solved.

00:01:35.462 --> 00:01:37.397
We have a comprehensive solution

00:01:37.397 --> 00:01:38.231
that we've been working on

00:01:38.231 --> 00:01:39.766
for almost two years now

00:01:39.766 --> 00:01:40.934
with the Biden administration.

00:01:40.934 --> 00:01:42.602
And we're ready to implement it.

00:01:42.602 --> 00:01:43.403
And I think that's

00:01:43.403 --> 00:01:44.337
probably the best place

00:01:44.337 --> 00:01:46.139
to start this conversation.

00:01:46.139 --> 00:01:46.940
So, well,

00:01:46.940 --> 00:01:48.074
the place that a lot of these

00:01:48.074 --> 00:01:48.775
national security

00:01:48.775 --> 00:01:50.443
experts and members of Congress

00:01:50.443 --> 00:01:52.479
started is with China's

00:01:52.879 --> 00:01:55.048
national intelligence law from 2017

00:01:55.081 --> 00:01:56.683
as you know which states quote

00:01:56.683 --> 00:01:58.218
any organization or citizen

00:01:58.218 --> 00:01:59.853
shall support, assist and cooperate

00:01:59.853 --> 00:02:01.488
with state intelligence work

00:02:01.488 --> 00:02:02.388
in accordance

00:02:02.388 --> 00:02:03.089
with the law

00:02:03.089 --> 00:02:04.190
and maintain the secrecy

00:02:04.190 --> 00:02:05.859
of all knowledge of state intelligence

00:02:05.859 --> 00:02:07.327
work, unquote,

00:02:07.327 --> 00:02:08.695
which a lot of national security

00:02:08.695 --> 00:02:10.230
experts and members of Congress interpret

00:02:10.230 --> 00:02:12.599
this as saying that this law compels

00:02:12.599 --> 00:02:14.434
any private company in China

00:02:14.434 --> 00:02:15.301
to cooperate

00:02:15.301 --> 00:02:17.704
with Chinese national intelligence

00:02:17.704 --> 00:02:18.838
any way they want.

00:02:18.838 --> 00:02:21.174
Which means that you sitting here right

00:02:21.174 --> 00:02:22.041
now, although I'm

00:02:22.041 --> 00:02:23.176
sure you wish you could.

00:02:23.176 --> 00:02:24.477
You cannot guarantee

00:02:24.477 --> 00:02:25.712
that the Chinese government

00:02:25.712 --> 00:02:27.046
can't get access to the tick

00:02:27.046 --> 00:02:28.715
tock user database.

00:02:28.715 --> 00:02:29.549
That's that's

00:02:29.549 --> 00:02:30.650
what people are worried about.

00:02:30.650 --> 00:02:31.417
Well well, no

00:02:31.417 --> 00:02:32.986
company can guarantee that

00:02:32.986 --> 00:02:33.753
a state actor

00:02:33.753 --> 00:02:35.522
can't get access to the company.

00:02:35.522 --> 00:02:36.723
But I mean, legally, not through

00:02:36.723 --> 00:02:38.224
hacking legally. Sure.

00:02:38.224 --> 00:02:39.459
But like one thing, like tick

00:02:39.459 --> 00:02:40.593
tock is not available in China.

00:02:40.593 --> 00:02:42.729
We have many safeguards in place.

00:02:42.729 --> 00:02:44.731
But again, if that's the concern,

00:02:44.731 --> 00:02:45.598
there are many companies

00:02:45.598 --> 00:02:46.533
that this would apply to.

00:02:46.533 --> 00:02:47.834
But the unique thing for us

00:02:47.834 --> 00:02:49.335
is that we do have a solution

00:02:49.335 --> 00:02:50.403
that's ready to be deployed

00:02:50.403 --> 00:02:51.871
that we've already proactively worked on

00:02:51.871 --> 00:02:53.540
with companies like Oracle

00:02:53.540 --> 00:02:55.441
to safeguard Americans user data.

00:02:55.441 --> 00:02:56.242
And we're ready to do it

00:02:56.242 --> 00:02:57.110
as soon as

00:02:57.110 --> 00:02:58.077
as soon as the administration

00:02:58.077 --> 00:02:58.678
is ready to act.

00:02:58.678 --> 00:03:00.113
But what's the workable solution?

00:03:00.113 --> 00:03:02.015
How how do you solve it?

00:03:02.015 --> 00:03:02.282
I mean,

00:03:02.549 --> 00:03:04.017
we had the top Republican commissioner

00:03:04.017 --> 00:03:05.051
at the Federal Communications

00:03:05.051 --> 00:03:06.352
Commission, Brendan Carr,

00:03:06.352 --> 00:03:07.453
on the lead last week.

00:03:07.453 --> 00:03:08.688
I want you to get your reaction

00:03:08.688 --> 00:03:09.956
to what he told us

00:03:09.956 --> 00:03:11.391
about the Chinese government and

00:03:11.391 --> 00:03:12.492
access to user data

00:03:14.194 --> 00:03:15.261
underneath of it.

00:03:15.261 --> 00:03:15.895
It operates

00:03:15.895 --> 00:03:17.697
as a sophisticated surveillance towards

00:03:17.697 --> 00:03:18.831
pulling everything from search

00:03:18.831 --> 00:03:19.365
and browsing

00:03:19.365 --> 00:03:20.900
history, keystroke patterns,

00:03:20.900 --> 00:03:22.235
potentially biometrics,

00:03:22.235 --> 00:03:23.770
including face prints and voice prints.

00:03:23.770 --> 00:03:25.338
And for years we were told, don't worry,

00:03:25.338 --> 00:03:26.940
none of this is stored in China.

00:03:26.940 --> 00:03:28.241
But there is some internal communication

00:03:28.241 --> 00:03:28.808
from TikTok

00:03:28.808 --> 00:03:29.876
leaked over the summer

00:03:29.876 --> 00:03:30.643
that showed, quote,

00:03:30.643 --> 00:03:32.579
everything is seen back in China.

00:03:32.579 --> 00:03:34.681
So it's a real concern.

00:03:34.981 --> 00:03:35.582
Well, I mean,

00:03:35.582 --> 00:03:36.182
I appreciate

00:03:36.182 --> 00:03:36.649
I know

00:03:36.649 --> 00:03:38.084
Brendan Carr has been really interested

00:03:38.084 --> 00:03:38.885
in this issue for a while.

00:03:38.885 --> 00:03:40.453
But as you know, he's

00:03:40.453 --> 00:03:42.088
not on a government agency

00:03:42.088 --> 00:03:43.022
of jurisdiction over this

00:03:43.022 --> 00:03:44.057
and he's not an expert.

00:03:44.057 --> 00:03:44.624
And in fact,

00:03:44.624 --> 00:03:45.925
all the things that he rattled off

00:03:45.925 --> 00:03:47.727
are all false about information

00:03:47.727 --> 00:03:49.028
that we collect

00:03:49.028 --> 00:03:50.230
But the one thing that is accurate is

00:03:50.230 --> 00:03:52.565
we do store data here in the U.S.

00:03:52.565 --> 00:03:53.333
and we're moving things

00:03:53.333 --> 00:03:55.134
over to the Oracle cloud.

00:03:55.134 --> 00:03:55.969
And if this is a concern

00:03:55.969 --> 00:03:56.636
that people have,

00:03:56.636 --> 00:03:57.570
we have a solution

00:03:57.570 --> 00:03:59.372
that we're ready to implement

00:03:59.372 --> 00:04:00.306
to ensure that Americans

00:04:00.306 --> 00:04:02.375
user data is protected. What about that?

00:04:02.709 --> 00:04:04.811
The document, the internal communication

00:04:04.811 --> 00:04:05.345
from TikTok

00:04:05.345 --> 00:04:06.512
that leaked over the summer that showed

00:04:06.512 --> 00:04:08.114
everything is seen back in China

00:04:08.114 --> 00:04:09.582
That's just not that's just not accurate.

00:04:09.582 --> 00:04:11.985
I mean, we have a US based security team.

00:04:12.185 --> 00:04:13.286
We're working with Oracle.

00:04:13.286 --> 00:04:13.820
We're working with

00:04:13.820 --> 00:04:15.088
actual security agencies

00:04:15.088 --> 00:04:16.356
within the government.

00:04:16.356 --> 00:04:17.790
I think there's a lot of misinformation

00:04:17.790 --> 00:04:18.191
out there

00:04:18.191 --> 00:04:19.492
and a lot of what

00:04:19.492 --> 00:04:20.326
the commissioner was saying

00:04:20.326 --> 00:04:21.261
is just not accurate.

00:04:21.261 --> 00:04:22.862
So there was a German report

00:04:22.862 --> 00:04:23.930
in March of this year

00:04:23.930 --> 00:04:24.664
showing that TikTok

00:04:24.664 --> 00:04:25.932
censored references

00:04:25.932 --> 00:04:27.667
to concentration camps

00:04:27.667 --> 00:04:28.201
shadow

00:04:28.201 --> 00:04:29.402
banning, in their view, words

00:04:29.402 --> 00:04:31.537
such as Auschwitz or national socialism.

00:04:32.205 --> 00:04:34.040
And the fear is the US State Department

00:04:34.040 --> 00:04:36.109
obviously has accused China of genocide,

00:04:36.109 --> 00:04:38.144
holding up to 2 million ethnic weavers

00:04:38.344 --> 00:04:40.647
and other ethnic minorities in

00:04:40.647 --> 00:04:41.314
detention camps,

00:04:41.314 --> 00:04:43.283
detention camps, concentration camps

00:04:43.283 --> 00:04:45.351
in the Xinjiang province.

00:04:45.585 --> 00:04:46.886
And that that's what TikTok

00:04:46.886 --> 00:04:47.487
was censoring,

00:04:47.487 --> 00:04:50.690
not necessarily references to the German

00:04:51.257 --> 00:04:52.458
concentration camps.

00:04:52.458 --> 00:04:53.793
First of all, do you do you acknowledge

00:04:53.793 --> 00:04:55.261
that the Chinese government

00:04:55.261 --> 00:04:56.629
has these figures and others

00:04:56.629 --> 00:04:58.564
in concentrated concentration camps?

00:04:58.564 --> 00:04:58.765
Well,

00:04:58.765 --> 00:05:00.166
guess that's something that I focus on.

00:05:00.166 --> 00:05:01.467
But I can tell you that for content,

00:05:01.467 --> 00:05:02.502
moderation is done

00:05:02.502 --> 00:05:03.369
from the United States.

00:05:03.369 --> 00:05:03.836
We do not

00:05:03.836 --> 00:05:04.937
censor content

00:05:04.937 --> 00:05:07.640
on behalf of any government

00:05:07.640 --> 00:05:09.142
you can just go on the app and look

00:05:09.142 --> 00:05:09.475
and there's

00:05:09.475 --> 00:05:09.842
there's been

00:05:09.842 --> 00:05:10.877
there's been plenty of content.

00:05:10.877 --> 00:05:11.611
What do you make of this on

00:05:11.611 --> 00:05:12.478
something you focus on?

00:05:12.478 --> 00:05:13.413
You work for

00:05:13.413 --> 00:05:14.547
a Chinese government company.

00:05:14.547 --> 00:05:15.682
And the Chinese are accused

00:05:15.682 --> 00:05:16.883
of concentration camps

00:05:16.883 --> 00:05:18.418
and ethnic genocide.

00:05:18.418 --> 00:05:19.252
You can you can look

00:05:19.252 --> 00:05:20.553
you can find all of this content

00:05:20.553 --> 00:05:21.321
on TikTok.

00:05:21.321 --> 00:05:22.088
But why won't you

00:05:22.088 --> 00:05:23.823
why won't you acknowledge that?

00:05:23.823 --> 00:05:25.024
I mean, I can

00:05:25.024 --> 00:05:26.526
I'm just not I'm just not an expert on

00:05:26.526 --> 00:05:27.560
what's happening in China.

00:05:27.560 --> 00:05:29.329
So it's not an area that I'm focusing on.

00:05:29.329 --> 00:05:30.463
But you can look on the app

00:05:30.463 --> 00:05:31.564
and you'll find plenty of content

00:05:31.564 --> 00:05:32.465
about that as well.

00:05:32.465 --> 00:05:33.666
It's not something that we censor.

00:05:33.666 --> 00:05:35.301
It's not something that we draw back.

00:05:35.301 --> 00:05:35.835
All of that.

00:05:35.835 --> 00:05:36.769
Those decisions are made

00:05:36.769 --> 00:05:37.770
from the United States.

00:05:37.770 --> 00:05:39.439
Well, a viewer might see this and think,

00:05:39.439 --> 00:05:40.740
this guy won't even acknowledge

00:05:40.740 --> 00:05:41.774
that the Chinese are committing

00:05:41.774 --> 00:05:44.010
genocide against their own people.

00:05:44.010 --> 00:05:44.477
Why?

00:05:44.477 --> 00:05:44.977
You know,

00:05:45.545 --> 00:05:46.813
they would probably interpret

00:05:46.813 --> 00:05:47.280
that to be like,

00:05:47.280 --> 00:05:48.448
you're afraid of being fired

00:05:48.448 --> 00:05:50.516
if you acknowledge that that and that's.

00:05:50.817 --> 00:05:51.818
Jake, that's not that's not

00:05:51.818 --> 00:05:53.386
that's not accurate and that's not fair.

00:05:53.386 --> 00:05:53.920
Well, I'm just.

00:05:53.920 --> 00:05:54.554
Do you disagree

00:05:54.554 --> 00:05:55.221
that that's what people are

00:05:55.221 --> 00:05:56.222
how people are going to interpret it?

00:05:56.222 --> 00:05:57.623
I mean, that's all I can see, how that's

00:05:57.623 --> 00:05:58.658
you're interpreting it.

00:05:58.658 --> 00:05:59.826
Look, I think there are many human

00:05:59.826 --> 00:06:00.693
rights violations

00:06:00.693 --> 00:06:02.428
that are happening in China

00:06:02.428 --> 00:06:03.196
and around the world.

00:06:03.196 --> 00:06:04.564
I think these are very important.

00:06:04.564 --> 00:06:04.931
I mean, I'm

00:06:04.931 --> 00:06:05.732
not here to be

00:06:05.732 --> 00:06:07.300
the expert on UN human

00:06:07.300 --> 00:06:08.935
rights violations around the world.

00:06:08.935 --> 00:06:10.002
But if you want to look up of that,

00:06:10.002 --> 00:06:11.070
you can go to tick tock

00:06:11.070 --> 00:06:12.004
and you can look it up

00:06:12.004 --> 00:06:13.539
and you can see much information

00:06:13.539 --> 00:06:14.474
about that as you want.

00:06:14.474 --> 00:06:15.641
That's not something that's censored.

00:06:15.641 --> 00:06:16.075
By the app.

00:06:16.075 --> 00:06:16.209
I was

00:06:16.209 --> 00:06:17.710
I was responding to your question

00:06:17.710 --> 00:06:18.511
about whether or not

00:06:18.511 --> 00:06:20.046
that content is censored on TikTok.

00:06:20.046 --> 00:06:20.847
It certainly is not.

00:06:20.847 --> 00:06:21.581
So if a U.S.

00:06:21.581 --> 00:06:22.782
user were to make a video

00:06:22.782 --> 00:06:24.450
summarizing the 2022 U.N.

00:06:24.450 --> 00:06:24.917
report,

00:06:24.917 --> 00:06:26.119
which shows that

00:06:26.119 --> 00:06:27.920
China may have committed crimes

00:06:27.920 --> 00:06:30.022
against humanity in Xinjiang province,

00:06:30.590 --> 00:06:31.591
they would be able to see it.

00:06:31.591 --> 00:06:32.258
It wouldn't be banned.

00:06:32.258 --> 00:06:34.260
There wouldn't be absolutely go for it.

00:06:34.260 --> 00:06:35.161
I mean, that does not violate

00:06:35.161 --> 00:06:36.863
our content guidelines.

00:06:36.863 --> 00:06:37.397
I can't tell you

00:06:37.397 --> 00:06:38.564
if you did a video of that, Jake,

00:06:38.564 --> 00:06:39.332
that would go viral.

00:06:39.332 --> 00:06:39.632
That's something

00:06:39.632 --> 00:06:40.666
people would be interested in,

00:06:40.666 --> 00:06:41.501
but that doesn't violate

00:06:41.501 --> 00:06:42.301
our guidelines at all.

00:06:42.301 --> 00:06:43.803
So there was a 60 minutes report

00:06:43.803 --> 00:06:45.371
that I'm sure you saw that showed

00:06:46.372 --> 00:06:48.674
American kids on TikTok, and

00:06:48.674 --> 00:06:52.578
they were seeing images of self-harm

00:06:52.578 --> 00:06:55.615
and eating disorders, encouraging,

00:06:56.516 --> 00:06:58.017
encouraging

00:06:58.151 --> 00:07:00.520
psychological distress for these kids.

00:07:00.520 --> 00:07:01.053
And then there's

00:07:01.053 --> 00:07:02.321
the Chinese version of TikTok,

00:07:02.321 --> 00:07:03.623
which not it's not called TikTok.

00:07:03.623 --> 00:07:04.891
It's something else.

00:07:04.891 --> 00:07:06.192
And it was educational

00:07:06.192 --> 00:07:08.461
and there were automatic time limits.

00:07:08.461 --> 00:07:09.595
And somebody,

00:07:09.595 --> 00:07:10.329
a parent might see that

00:07:10.329 --> 00:07:11.431
and think the Chinese government

00:07:11.431 --> 00:07:13.466
is trying to destroy our kids from within

00:07:13.466 --> 00:07:14.233
the I'm just saying.

00:07:14.233 --> 00:07:14.467
Don't

00:07:14.467 --> 00:07:15.935
you think that that's the impression?

